// celebration), 4 Mega Strike. Index 0/1/2 = the samples the main scene target ACTUALLY had (1/2/4), not the ones asked for. Diagnostics only: nothing here changes a draw.
//   frames    buffers executed (the render rate, not the game's)         wanted   the compositor was asked for (MSC_FX_COMPOSITE on, the pass has a divisor, the trigger is met)
//   unavail   wanted, but the scene depth cannot be read (a multisampled target on the console): the effects are drawn in place at full size
